# Rust vendored crates (src-tauri has its own anchored /target/ in src-tauri/.gitignore)
/crates/**/target/
# Cargo.lock IS tracked here: CI runs `cargo test --manifest-path crates/*/Cargo.toml`
# standalone, so without the lock those runs resolve dependencies fresh every time
# and can go red on a day nobody touched this repo.
